Changed :attr:`vTime.from_ical <icalendar.prop.dt.time.vTime.from_ical>` and :meth:`vDuration.from_ical <icalendar.prop.dt.duration.vDuration.from_ical>` to raise :exc:`~icalendar.error.ICalParsingError` for invalid iCalendar TIME and DURATION values while preserving the malformed input on the exception. I used ChatGPT GPT-5.6 Sol to help analyze the affected parsing paths, debug test failures, and review the implementation and tests. @sairex53
